{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "凪": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nagi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今すぐ見る": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See It Now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "凪を終了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit Nagi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ まで一時停止中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paused Until %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 時間": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For 1 Hour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いつもどおり": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As Usual"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ふつう": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Normal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ゆっくり": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Slow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "エフェクト": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effects"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーボードとマウスから手を離して %lld 秒たつと、画面に木漏れ日が少しずつ現れます。手を動かすと、すぐに消えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When your hands have been off the keyboard and mouse for %lld seconds, komorebi slowly appears on the screen. It disappears as soon as you move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "コマ数を半分にする": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halve the Frame Rate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "システム設定での許可が必要です": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Needs approval in System Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ログイン時に起動": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open at Login"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ログイン項目を変更できません: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t change the login item: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ログイン項目を開く": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Login Items"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一時停止": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一時停止と設定は、メニューバーのしずくのアイコンから開けます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause and Settings are in the drop icon in the menu bar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一般": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "General"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日いっぱい": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For the Rest of Today"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "低電力モードのとき": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Low Power Mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全体の強さ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Overall Strength"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再開": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resume"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再開するまで": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Until Resumed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再開するまで一時停止中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paused Until Resumed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "凪(一時停止中)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nagi (Paused)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "凪へようこそ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcome to Nagi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "動画の再生中は出さない": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hide While Video Plays"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "始める": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手を止めてから現れるまで": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appears After Hands Rest For"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推奨に戻す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore Recommended"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "日の光で描くので、日が沈むと現れません。月が出ている夜は、月明かりで薄く現れます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It is drawn with sunlight, so it does not appear after sunset. On nights with a moon, it appears faintly by moonlight."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "深まる速さ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deepening"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面共有と画面収録に写す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show in Screen Sharing and Recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "設定を保存できません: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t save the settings: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@(画面収録の許可が必要)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (Needs Screen Recording)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 つを選ぶ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One at Random"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "エフェクトの出し方": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effects Shown"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "オンのものを重ねる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All That Are On"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "システム設定の「画面収録とシステムオーディオ録音」で凪をオンにし、凪を起動し直してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on Nagi in Screen & System Audio Recording in System Settings, then quit and reopen Nagi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "システム設定を開く": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取り込んでいるあいだは、メニューバーに紫の印が出ます。macOS が、ときどき許可を続けるか確かめることがあります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While Nagi captures the screen, a purple indicator appears in the menu bar. macOS may ask from time to time whether to keep allowing it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "権限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permissions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面収録": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screen Recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面収録を許可していないため、%@は出ません": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ doesn’t show without Screen Recording permission"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "許可しています": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "許可を求める": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask for Permission"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "雨と宝石は、後ろの画面を雨粒や結晶で屈折させるために、画面収録の許可を使います。取り込むのは凪が出ているあいだだけで、取り込んだ画面は Mac の GPU の中だけで使い、保存も送信もしません。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rain and gems use Screen Recording to bend the screen behind drops and crystals. Nagi captures the screen only while it shows, uses it only on your Mac’s GPU, and never saves or sends it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 つを選んで出す": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show One at Random"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "返事を待っています": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for Your Answer"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
